+
+`assignee` is an agent's name (1 to 64 characters, one line) or `null` to unassign. Answers 200 with the ticket. Only `open` and
+`in_progress` tickets can be assigned or unassigned: any other status is 409 `conflict`. Assigning a ticket to the agent it
+already has changes nothing: no audit entry, no notification, and `updated` stays. The agent is notified that the ticket was
+assigned to them; unassigning notifies nobody. The audit log records `ticket.assigned` or `ticket.unassigned`.
